Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《007系列之金枪人》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.33,0:01:50.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼拿克 拿辣酱来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick Nack, Tabasco !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.66,0:01:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻送来 斯卡曼加先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right away, Monsieur Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.19,0:02:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.78,0:02:26.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其余的待会给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get the rest later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在里面等他 从那道门进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for him in there, through that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:42.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很快就跟你会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will join you in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.91,0:03:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯卡曼加先生 蒸汽浴已准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your steam bath is ready, Monsieur Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样太没难度了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would have been too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是锁上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.53,0:04:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要到别处找 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll have to look elsewhere, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, AI . AI .
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.99,0:06:01.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你在哪里 别用枪指着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wherever you are, don't hold it against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯卡曼加先生 我不知你在哪里 可以找到你的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder where you can find your gun , Monsieur Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:15.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那小金枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your little golden gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会在哪儿呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些是我们以前没有试过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is something we haven't had before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:33.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想那会是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder what it can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:41.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我耍你的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fooled you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:47.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你越来越接近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're getting warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.63,0:06:52.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很接近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你如何下楼梯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, how are you going to get down the stairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是这么接近 然而又那么远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So near and yet so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.73,0:07:51.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了不起 斯卡曼加先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo, Monsieur Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done it again .
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.41,0:08:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是最好的 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one was the best, n'est-ce pas?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:02.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十分不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not bad . Not bad at all .
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.70,0:08:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果想要我的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you'll have to do better than that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:05.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就得有更好表现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you want to come into my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.37,0:08:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会做到的 我会享用你留给我的每一分钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get you yet, and I'll enjoy every sou you leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:12.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快累死我了 尼拿克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be the death of me yet, Nick Nack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.79,0:10:53.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长官 早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning , sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:57.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科尔索普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colthorpe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.71,0:11:00.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,参谋长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chief of Staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.67,0:11:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,007 你认识一个叫 斯卡曼加的家伙吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know about a man called Scaramanga, 007?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:05.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯卡曼加?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scaramanga?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.51,0:11:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你指那个拥有金手枪的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , yes. The Man with the Golden Gun .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:12.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在马戏班出生 父亲是 马戏演出指挥 大概是古巴人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Born in a circus. Father, the ringmaster, possibIy Cuban .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,母亲是英国人 玩蛇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother, English , a snake charmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.19,0:11:17.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他十岁时已精通花式射击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a spectacular trick shot artist by the time he was 10...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.02,0:11:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十五岁就在里约当上枪手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a local Rio gunman at 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.23,0:11:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏联国安会招揽他 让他在欧洲受训\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The KGB recruited him there and trained him in Europe
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.49,0:11:27.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那儿 他成为一个付出多 但报酬少的杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where he became an overworked , underpaid assassin .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.49,0:11:30.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在五十年代末期他自立门户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went independent in the late '50s.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.12,0:11:32.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次行动收取一百万元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Current price, $ 1 million a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.41,0:11:34.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,档案里没有他的相片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No photograph on file.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:38.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过他有一个很显著的特征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he does have one distinguishing feature, however,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个额外乳头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a superfluous papilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.42,0:11:42.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是乳腺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mammary gland .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.26,0:11:45.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第三个乳头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A third nipple, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.59,0:11:48.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他经常使用金枪弹 所以外号是"金枪人"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He always uses a golden bullet, hence, Man with the Golden Gun .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.05,0:11:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前居所不详\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Present domicile unknown .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.18,0:11:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我所知的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that's all .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这样问?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.60,0:11:59.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.73,0:12:01.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有趣的小装饰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charming trinket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.27,0:12:03.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我的号码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even has my number on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:05.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:07.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很明显 这子弹根本没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously it's useless as a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.32,0:12:10.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会付上一百万要我的性命?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean , sir, who would pay a million dollars to have me killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.95,0:12:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妒忌的丈夫、愤怒的厨子 受侮辱的裁缝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jealous husbands, outraged chefs, humiliated tailors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:15.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以说不完 而且这个小装饰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The list is endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.87,0:12:18.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还附上一张便条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moreover, this trinket, as you call it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:23.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要求特别呈递给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was sent with a note requesting special delivery to you .
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,署名是一个"S"字母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's initialed with an "S."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:27.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面的指纹已给中情局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scaramanga's fingerprints were on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,证实是属于斯卡曼加的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've been verified by the CIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.05,0:12:32.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为何要警告我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would he alert me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:34.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心理因素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Psychological .
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.81,0:12:37.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想倚重自己的名声 吓怕他的受害人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He counts on his reputation to terrify his intended victim .
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.77,0:12:39.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you , gentlemen .
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:52.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把你撤离目前的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm relieving you of your present assignment, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.83,0:12:57.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 长官 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir? - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.37,0:13:01.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能源危机仍然没解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The energy crisis is still with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.04,0:13:04.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全认同找出吉勃逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I respectfully submit that finding Gibson
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:07.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和他的太阳电池数据 是现在最重要的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his solar cell data is even more important than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.84,0:13:09.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is indeed .
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我不能祸及此事和其他任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can't jeopardize it or any mission
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全因为斯卡曼加突然出现射杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by having Scaramanga pop up and put a bullet in you .
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.18,0:13:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会批准你辞职的要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll endorse your request to resign .
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者你可以休假躲起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you can take a sabbatical and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.31,0:13:24.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到事情解决为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}go to ground until this matter's settled .
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.73,0:13:26.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者直到他把我杀死为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or until he kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.19,0:13:29.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有人知道他在哪里 或者他是什么模样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody knows where he is or what he looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.24,0:13:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说他比你有优势是没错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I think it's fair to assume that he has the edge on you .
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.03,0:13:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你同意吗? 没什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't you agree? That's all , 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:48.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我先找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I found him first, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.13,0:13:51.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,形势或会有变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that might change the situation .
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.05,0:13:53.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戏剧性地变化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dramatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.09,0:13:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:13:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见 邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day, Bond .
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:09.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钱班霓费尔班克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moneypenny, Fairbanks. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.36,0:14:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉斯加?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}AIaska?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.49,0:14:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 是002比尔费尔班克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Bill Fairbanks, 002.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:15.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的比尔 我怀念他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , poor Bill . I miss him .
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:17.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个金枪人却不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Man with the Golden Gun didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:19.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从没正式确定是他做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officially, that was never confirmed .
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.91,0:14:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事发时002在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where was 002 when it happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:23.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当年1969年 在贝鲁特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beirut, '69.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:27.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟一名叫萨达的女子 在夜总会内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a cabaret with a lady called Saida.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝鲁特?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beirut, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.59,0:14:32.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你比电脑还要出色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moneypenny, you are better than a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在各方面都是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In all sorts of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:38.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你从没好好利用它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you never take advantage of them .
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.43,0:14:40.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 钱班霓小姐?  - 是的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Miss Moneypenny. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:45.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , just one moment, darling .
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:47.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事 詹姆斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, James?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.52,0:14:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何不确定凶手是斯卡曼加?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why wasn't Scaramanga confirmed as the killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.65,0:14:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们找不到子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because they couldn't find the bullet,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.28,0:14:56.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}darling .
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.27,0:15:30.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahmed .
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.07,0:16:16.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安 我叫做邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening . My name is Bond .
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.90,0:16:18.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Bond .
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:22.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跳得非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your dancing is superb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:24.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So are you .
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.08,0:16:31.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你很帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are very handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:35.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很少会这样唐突的 但我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well , I don't usually intrude like this, but I . . .
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:39.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信我们有一个共同朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe we had a mutual friend .
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:40.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比尔费尔班克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill Fairbanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:41.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,费尔班克斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fairbanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.72,0:16:43.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:47.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说在他被袭击时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm told you were with him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.64,0:16:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是跟他一起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when he was rather rudely interrupted .
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:53.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错是比尔 那是个恐怖的晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}BiII . What a terrible night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.07,0:16:55.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我永不会忘记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.90,0:16:57.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到是谁射他的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see who shot him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:16:58.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我在他的怀里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I was in his arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.07,0:17:01.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闭上了眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My eyes were closed .
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少他死时快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least he died happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.03,0:17:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那颗子弹直穿过他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bullet went through him .
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.45,0:17:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿过他背脊到那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through his back and ended up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.12,0:17:11.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 穿过他脖子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, through his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在警方抵达前 我把子弹从墙上取出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take it out of the wall before the police arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.59,0:17:17.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它现在是我的护身符\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now it is my lucky charm .
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.59,0:17:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有它我不会跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never dance without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.51,0:17:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信比尔会很喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure Bill wouId have loved that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.93,0:17:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们忘记过去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But let us forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:30.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm .
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.14,0:17:32.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直希望你这样说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.31,0:17:34.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会在贝鲁特久留吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you staying long in Beirut?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.27,0:17:36.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,视乎情况吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.25,0:17:56.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真笨拙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clumsy of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.97,0:18:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的小腹真美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really do have a magnificent abdomen .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.40,0:18:23.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的香水! 不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , my perfumes ! No !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.27,0:19:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的护身符不见了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've lost my charm !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不这么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not from where I'm standing .
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.37,0:19:51.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计程车 要去饭店吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxi? Hotel , mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.91,0:19:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 到最近的药房去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. The nearest pharmacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.08,0:20:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种改制过的子弹 在撞击时变得偏平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dumdum bullets like this flatten on impact
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.67,0:20:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以求达到最高的杀伤力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for maximum wounding effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.42,0:20:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:06.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. I'm sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:09.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是在哪里和由谁制造的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But just tell me where it was made and by whom .
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.14,0:20:11.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好它仍完整\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}FortunateIy it's all in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,20点003克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}20. 003 grams.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.97,0:20:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们推断 它应该由一支 4点2公厘口径的枪射出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which leads us to deduce it was fired from a 4.2 millimeter gun .
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:20.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本没有4点2公厘口径的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colthorpe, there's no such thing as a 4.2 millimeter gun .
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.06,0:20:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使没有军事 或民事的军火制造商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact that no recognized munitions manufacturer,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.98,0:20:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,制造这样的子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}military or civil , produces such a bullet
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不代表它不存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't mean it doesn't exist, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.95,0:20:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"Q"也有为特别的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Q Branch have been making irreguIar calibers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.12,0:20:35.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而制造特别口径的手枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for most unusual purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.20,0:20:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们也没把记号或型号刻上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we don't put markings or serial numbers on them .
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.75,0:20:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以几乎不能确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Making identification almost impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:43.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法追寻那子弹的来源?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean to say there's no way to trace that bullet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:45.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道它怎样来到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea what it went through to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:47.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会详细覆述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't go so far as to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.01,0:20:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以我们的标准来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The workmanship is undemanding
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它的手工不算精细\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}according to our standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.59,0:20:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,23开纯金混以少量镍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soft 23 karat gold with traces of nickel .
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.02,0:20:58.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欧洲很少使用 是来自印度的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hardly ever used in Europe. Comes from India.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.98,0:21:00.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,远东?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Far East?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.77,0:21:03.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何不可是印度?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not India?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.31,0:21:05.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镍含量明显很少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nickel content obviously too low, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.61,0:21:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉萨?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lazar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.41,0:21:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm .
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.16,0:21:15.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满幻想力 很专业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imaginative. Highly specialized .
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.66,0:21:17.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对! 我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I concur.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.67,0:21:24.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉萨是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well , what the hell is Lazar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:26.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是"什么" 是"谁" 葡萄牙人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not what. Who. Portuguese.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.63,0:21:27.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住在澳门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lives in Macau .
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.01,0:21:30.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是制造那指弹的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chap who made the bullet, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.49,0:21:59.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉打扰你们晚膳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate to interrupt your dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.37,0:22:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉萨先生住在这儿吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but does Senhor Lazar live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.17,0:22:05.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉萨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lazar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.17,0:22:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人给我这个地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was given this address.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:15.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是否?  拉萨先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he. . . Senhor Lazar?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:20.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫做邦德 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name's Bond . James Bond .
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.89,0:22:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不到的荣幸 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An unexpected honor, Mr. Bond .
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.73,0:22:25.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,久仰大名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your reputation precedes you .
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.23,0:22:26.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请到这边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.99,0:22:34.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若我可以为你制造某东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be the proudest moment of my career
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那将是我的荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I could make something for you , Mr. Bond .
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.78,0:22:38.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来福枪吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A rifle, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.41,0:22:41.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有个很有趣的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, here we have an interesting problem .
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.21,0:22:44.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是为客人特制的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A custom-built model for a client
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.83,0:22:48.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不久前失去了两只手指 请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who recently lost two fingers. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.96,0:22:50.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他失去了扳机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He also lost his trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.63,0:22:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它藏于枪托内 扣压它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is housed in the butt. Squeeze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.73,0:23:07.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞄准器有点偏差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sights are a bit off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.31,0:23:10.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有五只手指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have five fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.19,0:23:12.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪托是供三只手指压力平衡的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The butt is balanced for the pressure of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.61,0:23:15.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你射低了一寸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why you were one inch too low.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.28,0:23:19.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里只有精湛手艺与高质素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you will find only craftsmanship and quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.58,0:23:22.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而那大量生产的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mass production ,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.08,0:23:26.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,譬如你的沃尔达PPK 则留给其他人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your Walther PPK, for instance, I leave to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.54,0:23:28.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么弹药呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about ammunition?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.13,0:23:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为个人要求而设计 无论要求怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Designed to individual requirements whatever they may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我要用黄金打造呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In gold , if I wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.47,0:23:36.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我替一个顾客做过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have already done that for a client.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.55,0:23:38.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.55,0:23:40.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗朗斯科斯卡曼加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Francisco Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.14,0:23:44.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟顾客的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My relationship with a client, Mr. Bond ,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.48,0:23:46.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是绝对保密的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is strictly confidential .
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.48,0:23:49.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如一个医生 神父跟忏悔者的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a doctor or priest with a penitent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.77,0:23:51.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.40,0:23:55.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你仍然为没手指的无赖造枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet you make guns for fingerless hoodlums,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.32,0:23:56.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为刺客制造子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bullets for assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.07,0:24:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生 子弹不会杀人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond , bullets do not kill .
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.33,0:24:02.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉扳机的人的手指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the finger that pulls the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.16,0:24:03.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.75,0:24:08.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正瞄准你的鼠蹊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm now aiming precisely at your groin .
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.38,0:24:12.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快说 否则你要 永远拿着你那话儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So speak, or forever hold your "piece."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.88,0:24:15.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过斯卡曼加先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have never seen Mr. Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.13,0:24:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以每颗子弹收费的情形下 他必定是你的最佳顾客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On a cost-per-bullet basis, he must be your best customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.18,0:24:20.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is true, but unfortunately
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.35,0:24:22.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是经常开火的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he seems onIy to fire them occasionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.18,0:24:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上一次的送货 是什么时候?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When was the last shipment?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.19,0:24:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生 不可能的 我不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond , this is impossible. I cannot. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.65,0:24:34.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.23,0:24:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,低了一寸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An inch too low.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.49,0:24:45.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才刚完成一张立刻运送的订单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have just completed an order for immediate delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.20,0:24:46.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁去收货?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who collects them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.37,0:24:47.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.71,0:24:49.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们叫我送去赌场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My instructions are to go the casino.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.25,0:24:51.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我收了钱 他们就消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am paid and they vanish .
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.60,0:25:47.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几分钟后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a few momen ts, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.02,0:25:49.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就会抵达香港海港\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we will be in Hong Kong Harbor,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.60,0:25:51.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是世上最繁忙的港口之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of the busiest ports in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.15,0:25:55.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请准备你们的护照及登陆证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I remind you to have your passports and landing cards ready
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.61,0:25:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以避免任何不必要的延误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order to avoid unnecessary delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.45,0:26:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,左手边是著名客轮 伊利沙白皇后号的残骸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On our left is the wreckage of the famous liner, Queen Elizabeth ,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.46,0:26:15.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它在1971年在这里神秘沉下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which sank here under mysterious circumstances in 1971 .
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.59,0:26:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面就是九龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahead, you can now see Kowloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.38,0:26:22.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,右手边就是香港岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And on your right, Hong Kong Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.40,0:26:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计程车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxi !
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.83,0:26:50.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟着那辆劳斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow that Rolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.50,0:26:59.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐 请你把这倒转的 便盆驶开好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madam , would you be good enough to move this inverted bedpan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.17,0:27:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉我迟到 你在澳门的讯息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I'm late, James, but your signal
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.51,0:27:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才刚传到办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from Macau only just reached the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.01,0:27:06.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是好帮手 晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a great help, Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.34,0:27:09.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去交通部查一下那辆车吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, get on to the license bureau and trace that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.10,0:27:11.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"AU603"的绿色劳斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}AU603. A green Rolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.02,0:27:13.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绿色劳斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A green Rolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.81,0:27:15.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绿色劳斯莱斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A green Rolls-Royce.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.77,0:27:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,香港不会有太多的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There can't be that many in Hong Kong .
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.11,0:27:24.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有绿色劳斯莱斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Courtesy cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.32,0:27:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是半岛酒店的免费接客车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}AII green Rolls-Royces belong to the PeninsuIa Hotel .
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.57,0:27:28.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看两年的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see what a two-year posting
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.99,0:27:31.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对情报人员有多大转变?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to Staff Intelligence does for a girl .
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.08,0:27:34.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯 见到你真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, it's wonderful to see you .
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.71,0:27:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.33,0:27:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要一些资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need some information .
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.43,0:27:50.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被跟踪的目标人物 住在602号房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The subject under surveillance is occupying Room 602.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.30,0:27:51.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我请你吃晚饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll buy you dinner tonight, Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.85,0:27:54.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我先要办些正经事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But first I have a little official business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.35,0:27:56.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到那正经事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I saw the official business.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.06,0:28:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安 经过这两年 我会对你那样做吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodnight, would I do that to you after two years?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.69,0:28:02.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会 你一定会!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you bloody well wouId .
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.91,0:28:09.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 让我帮你 - 不用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please. - I can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.91,0:28:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你可替我开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , you could open a door for me, though .
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.17,0:28:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我替你开香槟吧?  - 不 这是惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I open champagne. - It's a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.88,0:28:23.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是惊喜!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , a surprise !
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.32,0:29:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good afternoon .
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.16,0:29:36.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水枪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A water pistol?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.70,0:29:38.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把浴袍拿给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pass me that robe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.38,0:29:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around .
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.30,0:29:54.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你经常带手枪沐浴的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you always take a shower with a pistol?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.77,0:30:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举高手 离开这里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands up and get out of here !
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.02,0:30:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep on walking .
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.53,0:30:11.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没回答我的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you haven't answered my question .
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.79,0:30:23.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接待处 有什么可帮你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reception. Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.38,0:30:26.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是602号房间的安黛拉小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Miss Anders, Room 602.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.71,0:30:29.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它放下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put those down !
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.72,0:30:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白这些烟盒上面 为何写上政府忠告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see why these packets carry a government warning .
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.38,0:30:35.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还给我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.76,0:30:39.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它的确会危害你的健康\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They certainly can damage your health .
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.44,0:30:45.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你弄疼我的手臂!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hurting my arm .
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.15,0:30:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可扭断它除非你 说出那些子弹的下落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll break it unless you tell me where those bullets go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.36,0:30:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能说!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.98,0:30:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试一试!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.61,0:30:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他会杀掉我!  - 谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He'll kill me. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.24,0:30:57.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能告诉你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you .
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.41,0:30:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯卡曼加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.75,0:31:06.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肯试不就做到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see what you can do when you try?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.00,0:31:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你替他工作?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You work for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.01,0:31:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't work for him .
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.59,0:31:18.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我是他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's. . . I'm his. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.47,0:31:20.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是你的爱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , so he's a lover, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.43,0:31:23.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是在他杀人之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only before he kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.77,0:31:25.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斗牛勇士也是那样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullfighters do the same thing .
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.10,0:31:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说可以改善目力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claim it improves the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.81,0:31:30.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要杀我 我可在哪里找到他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His eye is on me. Where can I find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.23,0:31:34.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.45,0:31:36.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said where?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.61,0:31:38.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道!  他不是什么都告诉我的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know where. He doesn't tell me everything .
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.99,0:31:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他今晚会在露臀夜总会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know he has a date at the Bottoms Up Club tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.08,0:31:45.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎认得出他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How will I recognize him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.41,0:31:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高 瘦 黑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tall , slim and dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.96,0:31:48.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那跟我的阿姨一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So is my aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.50,0:31:50.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有任何特征吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything distinctive about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.63,0:31:52.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有 不过我如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but how can I . . .
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.96,0:31:55.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不像普通人 他有三个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not like other people. He has three. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.55,0:31:56.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh .
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.30,0:31:59.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇妙的解剖学趣闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fascinating anatomical tidbit
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.72,0:32:02.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我所听过最没用处的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but probably the most useless piece of information I ever heard .
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.81,0:32:05.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非露臀夜总会是 一间脱衣舞厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless of course the Bottoms Up is a strip cIub
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.73,0:32:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而斯卡曼加又在那儿表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Scaramanga is performing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.98,0:32:12.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要说多一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll have to do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.24,0:32:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他通常穿着白色麻布西装 戴黑色领带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He usually wears a white linen suit, black tie,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.86,0:32:19.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首饰全是黄金造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and jewelry, aII goId .
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.99,0:32:22.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有进步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're improving .
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.83,0:32:25.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望你再扭我的臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you to twist my arm again .
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.12,0:32:29.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to either.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.46,0:32:32.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着我给你的吩咐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'll tell you what you're going to do, Miss Anders.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.17,0:32:35.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿那些金子弹给斯卡曼加先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to take those golden bullets to Mr. Scaramanga
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.01,0:32:37.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他拿不到子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because if he doesn't get them ,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.68,0:32:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不会在露臀夜总会出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he may not show up at the Bottoms Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.05,0:32:44.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在那里看到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.77,0:32:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为何相信我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.89,0:32:48.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.14,0:32:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过若斯卡曼加听到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But neither will Mr. Scaramanga trust you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.19,0:32:53.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的对话他也不会相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if he hears about this interesting little conversation .
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.69,0:32:55.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁晓得?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.19,0:32:58.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他或会用一颗金子弹对付你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He may even use one of those little golden bullets on you .
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.86,0:33:01.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就太可惜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that would be a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.03,0:33:04.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为子弹非常贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because they're very expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.04,0:33:07.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会拿给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take them to him .
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.04,0:33:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝一杯吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's drink to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.80,0:33:16.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干杯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bottoms up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.93,0:33:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏打还是姜汁汽水?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soda or ginger ale?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.14,0:33:28.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,劳烦你 姜汁汽水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ginger ale, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.83,0:35:56.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察! 把枪放下!  放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police ! Drop it! Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.75,0:36:00.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已被逮捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.84,0:36:08.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走近!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move away from there !
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.89,0:36:16.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,检查那把枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you take the trouble to examine that gun ,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.48,0:36:17.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是没开过火的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll notice it hasn't been fired .
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.02,0:36:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有任何话要说 到了警局再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything you have to say, you can say at the station .
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.28,0:36:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以第473条例控告你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm charging him under Section 473.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.38,0:36:46.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没看到你的工作证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't see your identity card .
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.42,0:36:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待会就会看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will .
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.11,0:37:07.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是到警局吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. I thought we were going to the police station .
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.40,0:37:09.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到九龙那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kowloon side.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.05,0:38:52.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九龙在那边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kowloon's over there !
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.13,0:38:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去新界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are going to the New Territories.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.76,0:39:43.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎 邦德指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome aboard, Commander Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.77,0:39:49.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请来这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.40,0:39:56.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请走到舱口下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down the hatchway, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.12,0:40:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening , sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.04,0:40:07.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请跟我来 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you follow me, pIease?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.42,0:40:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它肯定给你一个新的倾向吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm . It certainly gives you a new slant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.43,0:40:17.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,附近有中国舰队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What with the Chinese on one side
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.93,0:40:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有美国舰队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the American fleet on the other,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.39,0:40:23.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,香港只有这地方是不会被窃听的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}down here's the only place in Hong Kong you can't be bugged .
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.02,0:40:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以香港现在的房地产价格来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And , with current real estate prices in Hong Kong ,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.23,0:40:27.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确是蛮便宜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}quite practical , really.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.64,0:40:29.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有发现吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.35,0:40:31.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们打捞到的中国战机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chinese fighter we managed to salvage.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.20,0:40:41.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening , 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.33,0:40:44.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你仍与我们一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad to see you're still with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.96,0:40:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你将来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In future, Commander Bond , if you must
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.96,0:40:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要去游览绿灯户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tour the world of Suzie Wong by night,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.51,0:40:58.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请通知我们的手下 赫副官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}kindly inform our man here, Lieutenant Hip.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.80,0:41:00.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.18,0:41:02.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你摆脱香港警方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to get you away from the Hong Kong police
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.10,0:41:04.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但又不知道你掌握了多少情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but didn't know how much you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.18,0:41:08.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么也不知道 但我应报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing . But I think I should report, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.64,0:41:11.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯卡曼加不是要暗杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Scaramanga does not have a contract on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.94,0:41:13.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他今晚有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He couldn't have missed me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.15,0:41:15.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他杀了一个家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead he hit some chap coming out of a club.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.07,0:41:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到那是谁后 使我颇惊讶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got quite a shock when I saw who it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.99,0:41:21.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也料到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should think you did .
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.49,0:41:24.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们失踪了的 太阳能源专家吉勃逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our missing solar energy expert, Gibson .
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.66,0:41:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Gibson .
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.33,0:41:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他本来准备在某种情形下回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was prepared to come back under certain conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.58,0:41:32.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才与费雷泽教授在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I'm out here with Professor Frazier.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.17,0:41:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫副官在进行初步接触\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Hip was making a preliminary contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.05,0:41:39.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真想让斯卡曼加暗杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost wish that Scaramanga had a contract on you .
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.22,0:41:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉勃逊合作吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was Gibson cooperative?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.68,0:41:45.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想要求豁免权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted to bargain for immunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.60,0:41:48.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他提议到曼谷商讨细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suggested another meeting in Bangkok to discuss terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.23,0:41:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何选择曼谷?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why Bangkok?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.43,0:41:51.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他好像在当地为海发办事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the impression he worked there for Hai Fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.06,0:41:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾听过这名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That name's come up before.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.31,0:41:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是亿万富翁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A multimillionaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.73,0:41:56.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是海发企业的主管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head of Hai Fat Enterprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.86,0:41:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据我们所知 全都是合法生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of them legitimate as far as we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.99,0:42:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉勃逊用什么来讲条件?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did Gibson propose bargaining with , Lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.07,0:42:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太阳能感应器 声称95%有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A solex. Claimed it was 95% efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.53,0:42:09.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若他能发明那样有效能的电池 就能解决能源危机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he developed a solar cell that efficient, he solved the energy crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.41,0:42:11.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已告诉过我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you've told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.37,0:42:13.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,煤和石油迟早会用尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coal and oil will soon be depleted .
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.38,0:42:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铀又太危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uranium's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.21,0:42:19.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地热和潮水控制太昂贵 我很清楚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geothermal and tidal control too expensive. I know all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.09,0:42:20.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太阳能感应器现在在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the solex now?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.72,0:42:22.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是太阳能感应震动器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Solex agitator, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.68,0:42:26.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是把太阳光线转变为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The essential unit to convert radiation from the sun into electricity
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.47,0:42:28.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,工业用的电力的重要东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on an industrial basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.22,0:42:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这样大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only about that size.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.85,0:42:32.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快就可以知道那是否有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't take me long to check out Gibson's efficiency claim .
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.27,0:42:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真叫人兴奋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is really exciting .
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.27,0:42:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以看看吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I see it, Lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.27,0:42:41.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他曾在酒吧拿给我看 但又放回口袋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He showed it to me at the bar and replaced it in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.70,0:42:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而当他被杀后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And after he was shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.12,0:42:46.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.37,0:42:48.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I looked .
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.50,0:42:52.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M: Gentlemen , I congratulate you .
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.96,0:42:55.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还以为可以得到一个 改良了的太阳能感应器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead of getting our hands on a perfected solex,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.38,0:42:58.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还只得一条没用的尸体 毫无线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're left with a useless corpse and no leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.46,0:43:01.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One lead , sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.97,0:43:05.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假设吉勃逊被斯卡曼加所杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assuming Gibson was killed by Scaramanga,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.97,0:43:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聘用他的能付上一百万元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whoever hired him could afford a million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.51,0:43:10.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你指海发?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you suggesting Hai Fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.35,0:43:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有这财力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could afford it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.35,0:43:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对他来说是小数目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of petty cash .
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.98,0:43:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A thought has just occurred to me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.02,0:43:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果海发聘用斯卡曼加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Hai Fat hired Scaramanga,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.90,0:43:22.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他应该不会亲自跟他见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's highly unlikely that he met him personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.65,0:43:23.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.82,0:43:25.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若出了任何状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the event of anything going wrong ,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.16,0:43:27.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没什么可把他们连在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's nothing to connect the two.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.32,0:43:30.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这让我想到可如何走近他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that gives me an idea as to how to approach him .
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.54,0:43:33.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Q 我需要这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Q, I'll need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.33,0:43:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的 007!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, 007 !
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.21,0:43:40.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我承认这有点怪异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I admit, it's a little kinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.92,0:43:43.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带晚安一起去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll take Miss Goodnight with you .
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.84,0:43:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodnight, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.01,0:43:47.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经过今晚的失败后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After tonight's debacle,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.01,0:43:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个有效率的联络官 是不会有错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an efficient liaison officer wouldn't come amiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.60,0:43:55.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you , sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.39,0:43:56.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不可能接近海发的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't get anywhere near Hai Fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.06,0:43:58.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有亲杯在曼谷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have some relatives in Bangkok.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.77,0:44:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我经常经过他的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have often passed his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.52,0:44:03.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他住在山边一所大屋内 守卫森严\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lives in a big house on a mountainside surrounded by guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.20,0:44:49.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.74,0:44:51.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处都是守卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The place is crawling with guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.37,0:44:52.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.37,0:45:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海发很重视私隐的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hai Fat takes his privacy very seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.25,0:45:03.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定他会见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure he'll see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.45,0:45:31.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安 水怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning . How's the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.70,0:45:33.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何你不下水看看?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you come in and find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.95,0:45:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎很吸引 小姐是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds very tempting , Miss. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.45,0:45:37.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赵美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chew Mee.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.91,0:45:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.83,0:45:41.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well , there's only one small problem .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.71,0:45:43.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有游泳裤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no swimming trunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.42,0:45:45.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither have I .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.63,0:45:48.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}HAI FAT: What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.43,0:45:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.14,0:45:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻滚!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.81,0:45:58.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will have you . . .
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.82,0:46:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请原谅 斯卡曼加先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, forgive me, Mr. Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.66,0:46:15.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见 赵美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Chew Mee.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.37,0:46:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.91,0:46:22.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你了解到我的惊讶吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand my surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.42,0:46:25.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为大家了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was understood .
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.42,0:46:30.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不见面 斯卡曼加先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were never to meet, Mr. Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.80,0:46:33.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总以为你的特征只是个传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always thought your abnormality was a myth .
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.13,0:46:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些邪教相信 这是刀枪不入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are cults where it is considered a sign of invulnerability
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.68,0:46:38.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和高超的性能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and great sexual prowess.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.14,0:46:40.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经习惯了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've learned to live with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.85,0:46:42.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为何在这里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.02,0:46:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond . James Bond .
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.98,0:46:46.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识这个人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I know the gentleman?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.65,0:46:48.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well , he knows you .
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.61,0:46:49.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恕我大胆地说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without being immodest,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.78,0:46:52.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在世界这一端没有人不认识他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's hardly anyone in this part of the world who doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.95,0:46:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有很少人没听过邦德的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there are very few people who haven't heard of Bond .
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.28,0:46:59.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,英国特务情报员007有特权杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}British Secret Service, 007, licensed to kill .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.00,0:47:02.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使以我的标准来说 他非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's good , even by my standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.16,0:47:04.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他到过露臀夜总会附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was near the Bottoms Up Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.71,0:47:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是巧合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.63,0:47:08.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe in them .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.05,0:47:11.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙很危险 他知道一些事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man's a menace. He knows something .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.84,0:47:15.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想我再付一百万消灭他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you suggesting I invest another million to remove him?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.72,0:47:17.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那要看你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's up to you .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.64,0:47:20.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想想吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will give it some thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.22,0:47:22.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since you have chosen to meet me,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.77,0:47:24.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚来吃晚饭吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}perhaps you will dine here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.02,0:47:26.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,荣幸之至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be deIighted .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.27,0:47:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么九点整\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}9: 00 then .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.06,0:47:31.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凌波 送他走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ling Po, see this gentleman out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.33,0:47:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别告诉我你见到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me you saw him .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.58,0:47:49.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他甚至邀请我吃晚饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He even invited me to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.92,0:47:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他必定发觉我使他心痒痒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must have found me quite titillating .
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.52,0:48:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In due time, I shall be laid to rest here
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.94,0:48:15.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这充实、愉快 漫长的一生过后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in my mausoleum
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.07,0:48:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就会躺在我的钞墓内安息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after a useful , happy, long life.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.12,0:48:23.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让邦德缩短它的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I do not intend to allow Mr. Bond to shorten it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.00,0:48:33.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.13,0:48:35.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿跟你一起吃晚饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodnight, you know I'd much rather have dinner with you .
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.63,0:48:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白的 请你快回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , I understand , James. Please hurry back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.18,0:48:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我尽快致电你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll ring as soon as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.55,0:48:41.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吃夜宵吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A midnight snack might be just the thing .
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.64,0:48:44.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把酒保持冰冻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll keep the wine properly chilled .
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.64,0:48:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其余的都要暖暖的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And everything else warm , I trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.19,0:48:56.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye-bye. - Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.69,0:48:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其余的都要暖暖的吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"And everything else warm?"
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.16,0:49:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你不介意 送我两个侄女一程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you don't mind giving my nieces a lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.54,0:49:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening .
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.50,0:49:15.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海发正在途中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hai Fat's is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.55,0:49:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放下她们后 再回这里守候着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll drop the girls, come back here and hang around .
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.98,0:49:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye-bye. - Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.36,0:49:40.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是斯卡曼加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The name's Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.74,0:49:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海发先生约了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Fat is expecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.93,0:50:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"恐怖乐园"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Grislyland ."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.08,0:50:33.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pleasant evening .
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.71,0:51:23.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓他! 快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him . Come on .
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.52,0:51:35.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.48,0:51:39.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别在这里乱来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.15,0:51:43.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.11,0:51:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带邦德先生到学校去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take Mr. Bond to school .
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.30,0:52:03.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heaven .
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.84,0:52:08.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舒服死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely heaven .
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.21,0:54:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔希曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tashman .
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.22,0:55:33.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Chula.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chula.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.59,0:55:40.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Chula ! Chula ! Chula !\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chula ! Chula ! Chula !
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.77,0:55:45.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Chula ! Chula ! Chula !\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chula ! Chula ! Chula !
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.25,0:56:04.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Chula ! Chula ! Chula !\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chula ! Chula ! Chula !
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.80,0:56:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.17,0:56:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道我在此?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.38,0:56:58.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方是海发的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hai Fat owns this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.44,0:57:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand back, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.91,0:57:25.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忘记告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgot to tell you .
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.58,0:57:29.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们的父亲经营空手道学校的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their father runs a karate school .
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.89,0:58:30.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐稳!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on !
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.25,0:59:00.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位 这可算是一团糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you might call a Mexican screw off, gentlemen .
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.42,0:59:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮的小姐 一百铢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty lady. 100 baht.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.96,0:59:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,八十铢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. 80 baht.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.88,0:59:43.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十铢 漂亮的小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}50 baht, pretty lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.30,0:59:46.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的大象 五十铢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real elephant. 50 baht.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.82,1:00:03.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大象 很便宜的 先生 一百铢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elephant. Bargain , mister. 100 baht.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.24,1:00:12.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大象 是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elephant. Real elephant.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.29,1:00:14.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十铢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}50 baht.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.96,1:00:21.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很帅 四十铢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are very handsome man . 40 baht.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.38,1:00:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你个特价 二十铢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you , mister, 20 baht.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.67,1:00:26.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若你能使东西开快些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what, sonny, I'll give you 20, 000 baht
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.80,1:00:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就给你二万铢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you can make this heap go any faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.06,1:00:32.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二万铢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}20, 000 baht.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.39,1:00:37.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕我要欠你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid I'll have to owe you .
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.31,1:00:40.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死游客! 二万铢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bloody tourist! 20, 000 baht!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.67,1:01:01.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,岂有此理 你这污水猪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn little brown water hog !
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.34,1:01:03.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事 JW?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , what's the matter, J.W., hon?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.84,1:01:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你试在我的地方这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just try that in my bayou , boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.84,1:01:08.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我连你的屁股也扯掉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd haul your ass !
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.36,1:01:30.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,JW 看!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , look, J.W.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.32,1:01:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想买一只那些可爱小象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just gotta have me one of those cute little elephants.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.78,1:01:35.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,象!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elephant?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.83,1:01:37.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是支持民主党的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're Democrats, Maybelle.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.25,1:01:46.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫那些尖头怪脱下睡衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you got your little pointy heads out of them pajamas,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.05,1:01:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不会迟到上班!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you wouldn't be late for work!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.08,1:02:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早已料到!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}J .W. : I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.37,1:02:23.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些尖头怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pointy-heads has no more idea
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.38,1:02:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比信天翁的交通控制概念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of traffic control
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.04,1:02:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要差!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than a goony bird !
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.72,1:02:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别将你的鼻子 伸进我的裤子里 听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your cotton-picking schnoz out of my pants. Hear, now?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.41,1:03:02.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真丑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy. You is ugly.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.50,1:03:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,JW啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}J.W.?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.42,1:03:11.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.79,1:03:42.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在那学校教什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do they teach in that school?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.16,1:03:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芭蕾舞?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ballet dancing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.88,1:03:50.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不觉得让邦德逃走很好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I find nothing remotely amusing about Mr. Bond's escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.76,1:03:53.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你低估他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You underestimated him .
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.22,1:03:54.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使我的影响力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even my influence doesn't extend
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.01,1:03:57.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也伸展不到英国特工处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the British Secret Service.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.43,1:03:58.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该低调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall lie low, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.05,1:04:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会搞坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't intend to jeopardize the project
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.18,1:04:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我投资了一半财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in which I've invested half my fortune
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.18,1:04:05.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并会赚数十亿的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when it's ready to yieId billions.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.56,1:04:07.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会在哪里躲藏?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where will you hide out?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.27,1:04:09.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这跟你无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That does not concern you .
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.94,1:04:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个拿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.48,1:04:13.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他还给厂房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return it to the plant
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.86,1:04:16.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没我的准许别离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and don't leave there without my permission .
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.03,1:04:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提醒你 你是替我工作的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I remind you that you work for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.33,1:04:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我雇用你做初级合伙人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took you on as a junior partner
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.29,1:04:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是偶尔可以被利用一下罢了 没什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be an occasional convenience, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.08,1:04:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是聘用你来管我的事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not hire you to interfere in my affairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.92,1:04:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,清楚明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that clearly understood?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.09,1:04:32.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Very clearly.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.72,1:04:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至开始后悔考虑聘请你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I now regret having even considered employing your services.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.93,1:04:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过先别说这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that is beside the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.10,1:04:42.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德不知道你在曼谷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond doesn't know you're in Bangkok.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.89,1:04:45.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他从没见过你 但他认识我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's never seen you . But he knows me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.93,1:04:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是问题所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the problem .
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.19,1:04:49.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's no problem .
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.04,1:05:11.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.38,1:05:15.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海发先生刚刚辞职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Fat has just resigned .
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.96,1:05:18.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在是新董事主席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the new chairman of the board .
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.01,1:05:22.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一向都喜欢那个钞墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He always did like that mausoleum .
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.81,1:05:24.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他埋在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put him in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.83,1:05:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 都是赫副官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about that, darling . It was Hip.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.70,1:05:46.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没海发的影踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's still no sign of Hai Fat.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.83,1:05:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有查询都受到东方式的婉拒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every inquiry gets a polite Oriental brush-off.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.33,1:05:52.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬赠的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With compliments.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.29,1:05:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"培约"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Phuyuck"?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.00,1:05:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是1974年的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'74, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.30,1:06:05.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I approve.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.10,1:06:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.89,1:06:08.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是指酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , not the wine.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.02,1:06:10.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的连衣裙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your frock.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.44,1:06:11.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,适当的位置紧身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tight in all the right places.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.02,1:06:13.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钮扣不太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not too many buttons.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.65,1:06:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东南亚的标准制服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standard uniform for Southeast Asia.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.57,1:06:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钮扣在后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The buttons are down the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.28,1:06:21.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是由"Q"设计的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Designed by Q, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.03,1:06:24.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中一颗定是自杀药丸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of them's a suicide pill , I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.62,1:06:27.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 那钮扣内置自动引导装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but the bottom one has a homer in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.95,1:06:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有原创力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How original .
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.17,1:06:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A toast.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.71,1:06:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为这一刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To this moment
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.30,1:06:42.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和为将来的时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the moment yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.68,1:06:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们这行业 恐怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In our profession , I'm afraid ,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.39,1:06:52.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法指望那一刻来临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you never can count on that moment to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.06,1:06:56.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天晓得明年这个时候 你与我在何方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows where you and I will be this time next year?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.07,1:06:59.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是天各一方吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Opposite sides of the worId , most likely.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.74,1:07:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相距太远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's too far apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.16,1:07:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果赫副官找不到线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if Hip doesn't come up with a lead ,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.78,1:07:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚我们就没有什么要办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's really nothing very much for us to do tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.92,1:07:15.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者有呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or is there?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.29,1:07:19.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你使我心痒痒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , darling , I'm tempted .
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.71,1:07:24.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我没兴趣花几个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But killing a few hours as one of your passing fancies
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.89,1:07:26.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来打发你的幻想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}isn't quite my scene.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.30,1:08:06.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,培约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Phuyuck."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.32,1:08:23.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安 真叫人意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah . Goodnight, what a pleasant surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.82,1:08:27.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那"难以得手"的表现 很短促吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My hard-to-get act didn't last very long , did it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.78,1:08:30.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受过训练应付特如其来的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was trained to expect the unexpected ,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.54,1:08:35.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们没有教我应付 你穿着睡衣的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they never prepared me for anything like you in a nightie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.14,1:08:54.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为这件事永不会发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, I thought this wouId never happen .
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.23,1:09:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么使你改变主意?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What made you change your mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.69,1:09:05.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我意志薄弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.95,1:09:09.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.76,1:09:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安黛拉小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Anders.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.43,1:09:31.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你穿上衣服我认不出你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't recognize you with your cIothes on .
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.43,1:09:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我收买侍者让我进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bribed the bellboy to let me in .
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.18,1:09:36.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想来警告你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come to warn you .
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.77,1:09:38.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in great danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.64,1:09:39.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我经常都是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I usually am .
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.90,1:09:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我用三个枕头的旧把戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I use the old three-pillow trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.90,1:09:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请相信我 我冒险到来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please believe me. I'm risking my life to come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.78,1:09:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在乎我的安危令人感动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well , your concern for my well-being is touching
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.07,1:09:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也使我迷惑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but puzzles me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.58,1:09:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯卡曼加身在曼谷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scaramanga is in Bangkok.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.58,1:09:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也曾在香港 不过不是追杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was in Hong Kong , too, but not after me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.45,1:09:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们说过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been through that routine.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.54,1:10:04.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是猛兽 我讨厌他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a monster. I hate him .
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.96,1:10:06.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么离开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then leave him .
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.67,1:10:10.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能对斯卡曼加一走了之\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't walk out on Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.97,1:10:13.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定会找到我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no place he wouldn't find me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.47,1:10:15.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要一个好律师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need a good lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.35,1:10:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.77,1:10:19.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为谁把刻上你号码的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you think sent that bullet
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.94,1:10:21.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,子弹寄去伦敦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to London with your number on it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.73,1:10:24.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did .
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.98,1:10:31.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他的指纹印在 那纸条上很不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it wasn't easy getting his fingerprint on the note.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.66,1:10:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原谅我理解力迟钝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll forgive me if I've been a little slow on the uptake.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.74,1:10:40.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不明白你是世上 唯一可把他杀死的人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you see you're the only man in the world who can kill him?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.12,1:10:44.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何你有那个想法?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What gives you that idea?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.13,1:10:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯卡曼加对你的观感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way Scaramanga speaks about you .
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.38,1:10:50.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他甚至蛮喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even has a likeness of you .
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.13,1:10:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是过奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm flattered .
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.30,1:10:55.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want him dead .
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.31,1:11:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我一个价钱 什么都可以 我会付给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name your price. Anything . I'll pay it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.31,1:11:07.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若你喜欢 你也可得到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can have me, too, if you Iike.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.03,1:11:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也蛮有吸引力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not unattractive.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.49,1:11:14.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起码 你开始说出真相了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last you're starting to tell the truth .
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.08,1:11:21.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我梦想你释放我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've dreamed about you setting me free.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.17,1:11:31.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直梦想 那个太阳能感应震动器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been dreaming about a solex agitator.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.64,1:11:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有听过吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever heard of one?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.64,1:11:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者你也可得到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you can have that, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.20,1:12:03.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我的衣服在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, my clothes are in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.29,1:12:07.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要宰掉那女人!  - 晚一点吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll kill that woman . - Later.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.94,1:12:28.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很迷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charming .
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.62,1:12:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寄出那子弹是个妙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an inspiration sending that bullet.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.92,1:13:33.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're late.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.46,1:13:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是两片连映\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a double feature.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.97,1:13:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.47,1:13:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放好手饰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Putting my jewelry away.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.66,1:14:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can come out now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.82,1:14:04.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在几点?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.16,1:14:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2: 00-ish .
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.66,1:14:06.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两点?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2: 00?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.50,1:14:09.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我躲在这里两个小时?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mean I've been in here for two hours?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.79,1:14:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是职责的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All in the line of duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.83,1:14:14.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,职责! 我明早辞职了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duty? I'm resigning in the morning .
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.84,1:14:16.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让我们失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , Goodnight, come on , don't let us down .
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.01,1:14:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特工处需要像你这样的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Service needs women like you .
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.51,1:14:20.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但很明显你不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well , obviously you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.30,1:14:25.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原谅我吧 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me, darling .
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.35,1:14:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我答应你会轮到你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your turn will come, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.60,1:14:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要她把那仪器带来给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as she brings me that solex.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.06,1:14:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为杀斯卡曼加?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For killing Scaramanga?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.90,1:14:34.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果她首先替我拿到 太阳能感应震动器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she gets me the solex agitator first.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.40,1:14:36.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.53,1:14:40.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯 别乱来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, you must be good .
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.86,1:14:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm .
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.16,1:14:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到我下次见到她时就会知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find out about that the next time I meet her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.45,1:14:51.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她已在安排了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's making the arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.25,1:15:33.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉我迟到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry I'm Iate.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.50,1:15:36.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曼谷的交通很糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bangkok traffic's worse than Piccadilly.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.46,1:15:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经联络过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's made contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.84,1:15:40.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个帅哥好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's the charm boy doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.05,1:15:42.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还用你问?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need you ask?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.59,1:15:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在外面见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet you outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.64,1:15:49.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有把它带来吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you bring it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.84,1:16:21.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把它留在你手提包内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling , I left it in your handbag .
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.25,1:16:22.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定在里面的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be in here somewhere, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.63,1:16:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我见到店内那男人给了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw the man in the shop give it to you .
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.01,1:16:27.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有那张票 我们不能在海关拿到收据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without the ticket, we can't get a receipt for customs.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.97,1:16:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找不到的了 我在你来之前已看过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't find it in there, Mr. Bond . I looked before you came.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.47,1:16:32.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会那样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't do that either.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.81,1:16:33.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看你背后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look behind you .
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.14,1:16:37.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,低一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lower.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.27,1:16:42.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花生袋里的手枪 真有创意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gun and a bag of peanuts. How original .
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.53,1:16:43.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一步呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will they think of next?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.20,1:16:49.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫做斯卡曼加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.37,1:16:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗朗斯科斯卡曼加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Francisco Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.16,1:16:52.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得是认识你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel I know you ,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.45,1:16:54.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我从没想过我们会见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}although I never thought we should ever really meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.00,1:16:56.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是我的荣幸 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a very great pleasure for me, Mr. Bond ,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.92,1:16:58.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全赖安黛拉小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thanks to Miss Anders.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.42,1:17:01.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你表示感激的方法真特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've a strange way of showing your gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.00,1:17:04.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一妇不能侍二主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mistress cannot serve two masters.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.84,1:17:08.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛心的一枪 但十分感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A difficult shot, but most gratifying .
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.05,1:17:12.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都各自玩得痛快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well , we all get our jollies one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.01,1:17:15.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的喜好一直是枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine have always been guns, Mr. Bond .
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.89,1:17:19.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我儿时在马戏团中长大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was a boy, I was brought up in a circus.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.15,1:17:23.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我唯一的朋友是一只非洲大象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My only real friend was a magnificent African bull elephant.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.19,1:17:27.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一天他的训练员虐待他 他发狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day his handler mistreated him and he went berserk.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.70,1:17:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,流血 将要死时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bleeding , dying ,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.20,1:17:34.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he came and found me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.00,1:17:39.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,单脚站立 这是他的绝招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stood on one leg , his best trick,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.92,1:17:41.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把我提起放在他背上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}picked me up and put me on his back.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.67,1:17:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙用枪射他的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man emptied the gun into his eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.18,1:17:52.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用我的手枪向他还以颜色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I emptied my stage pistol into his.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.51,1:17:54.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以眼还眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An eye for an eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.47,1:17:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nut?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.23,1:18:04.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生 我一直以为自己喜欢动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, Mr. Bond , I always thought I liked animals
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.23,1:18:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来我发现我更喜欢杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I discovered that I liked killing people even more.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.41,1:18:18.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保管它 无论如何别掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep this. Whatever you do, don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.96,1:18:21.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回去帮詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to get back to help James.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.50,1:18:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出了状况吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's gone wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.63,1:18:23.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个侏儒用枪指着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a midget with a gun on him .
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.04,1:18:25.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,侏儒?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A midget?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.71,1:18:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我在露臀夜总会外见到的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same one I saw outside the Bottoms Up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.30,1:18:29.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女孩死了 通知警方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the girl is dead . Call the poIice.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.81,1:18:39.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管这个女孩 她可以被取代的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget the girl . She's repIaceable.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.10,1:18:41.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会查看她偷了我什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall find what she stole from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.94,1:18:43.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对你没有敌意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Personally, I've got nothing against you , Mr. Bond ,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.94,1:18:46.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望我们不会再有任何瓜葛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so let us hope our paths never cross again .
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.77,1:18:48.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请别跟踪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't try to follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.69,1:18:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那个拿花生的朋友不会喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your peanut-toting friend back there wouldn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.99,1:18:53.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.71,1:19:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要试我的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to try one of mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.64,1:19:20.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那太阳能感应器呢?  - 给了晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the solex? - I gave it to Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.31,1:19:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那么她在哪?  - 在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And where's Goodnight? - Outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.51,1:19:59.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一定是在车旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She must be by the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.25,1:20:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人啊 给我通话器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Women . Walkie-talkie.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.55,1:20:36.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安 你在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodnight, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.72,1:20:38.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被锁在行李厢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody locked me in a boot.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.55,1:20:39.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a what?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.72,1:20:42.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被锁在那侏儒的车内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The midget's car. I'm locked in.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.68,1:20:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车子是古铜色的 车顶黑色 车牌7543\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bronze car with a black roof, number 7543.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.90,1:20:55.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 车钥匙!  - 我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The keys. - I haven't got them .
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.07,1:20:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.57,1:21:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安 车钥匙呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodnight, where are the car keys?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.45,1:21:05.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我手上 那太阳能感应器也在我手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got the keys. And I've got the solex, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.62,1:21:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计程车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxi !
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.08,1:21:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别逃 我们看到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay in there, Goodnight. We've got you spotted .
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.30,1:21:22.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计程车 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}HIP: Taxi ! Taxi !
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.94,1:21:38.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以示范一下吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a demonstration , boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.57,1:21:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.71,1:21:51.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟发生什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.09,1:22:00.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是谁!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I know you !
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.14,1:22:02.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , no.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.51,1:22:04.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是那情报员!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're that secret agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.56,1:22:06.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来自英国特工处的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That English secret agent from England .
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.99,1:22:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在追着某人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're chasing somebody.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.53,1:22:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次要追谁? 共产党员?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who you after this time, boy? Commies?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.28,1:22:24.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去抓他们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go get them .
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.53,1:22:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我全力支持你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm with you all the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.13,1:22:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎有麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-oh ! I think we've got trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.52,1:22:59.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下你们的车 你们这些黄种尖头怪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull your cars over, you little brown pointy-heads !
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.86,1:23:01.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是警察!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a peace officer!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.11,1:23:06.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在吗? 詹姆斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, are you still there? James?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.70,1:23:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听到吗? 詹姆斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you hear me? James !
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.54,1:23:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 别怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Goodnight. Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.08,1:23:13.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁?  是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that? It's. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.84,1:23:18.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是总部 - 让我跟他们说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's headquarters. - Let me talk to them .
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.30,1:23:22.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 我是路易斯安那州 警察局的佩帕警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello. This is Sheriff J .W. Pepper, Louisiana State Police.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.13,1:23:25.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我那身在纳里饭店的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you call my wife at the Narai Hotel
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.14,1:23:27.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有任务在身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tell her I'm on a mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.14,1:23:29.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被委任做代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been deputized .
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.81,1:23:31.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吗?  对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right? Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.77,1:23:34.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要追哪辆车?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which car are we all chasing , boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.13,1:24:48.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让开! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.35,1:24:51.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那堆废铁驶离马路!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that piece of junk off the road !
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.42,1:25:21.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们去了左边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They went to the left, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.85,1:25:33.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Press that pedal , boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.03,1:25:50.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们到底去了哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell they got to?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.38,1:26:06.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出错了 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You goofed , boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.39,1:26:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近的桥在两里后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nearest bridge is two miles back.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.07,1:26:32.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死! 你在?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}J .W. : God damn ! What the. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.12,1:26:36.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事? 你想做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on? What the hell you doing now, boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.91,1:26:41.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桥在那边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bridge is that way!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.25,1:26:47.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会是想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not thinking of. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.21,1:26:49.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sure am , boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.51,1:26:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有听过亡命特技人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever heard of Evel Knievel?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.03,1:27:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没试过这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never done that before !
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.44,1:27:12.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我也没试过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well , neither have I , actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.84,1:28:10.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去对付他们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go get them , boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.63,1:28:51.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要管 这是我的部门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay put, boy. This is my department.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.05,1:28:56.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们有这能耐真好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad to see you boys are on the ball .
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.93,1:29:00.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是路易斯安那州 警察局的佩帕警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff J .W. Pepper, Louisiana State Police.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.26,1:29:01.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的身份证明 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's my identification .
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.97,1:29:05.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,执法联会 美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Law Enforcement Association , American Legion .
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.43,1:29:08.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我与我的搭挡在执行秘密任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and my partner here, we're on a secret mission .
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.85,1:29:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! What the hell you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.36,1:29:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把钱包还给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Give me my wallet back.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.25,1:29:33.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.45,1:30:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不可以这么做!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}J .W. : You can't do this to me !
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.16,1:30:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把钱包还给我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want my wallet back!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.79,1:30:09.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解开这手铐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take these goddamn bracelets off!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.92,1:30:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要告你们错误拘捕 警察施暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna sue ya for false arrest, police brutality!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.21,1:30:17.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有熟人的! 我叫联邦调查局 和中情局教训你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got connections ! I'm gonna get the FBI on your ass, the CIA.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.63,1:30:20.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,岂有此理 我要找季辛吉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God damn it, I'm gonna get Henry Kissinger!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.51,1:30:24.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我 我在跟你讲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me when I'm talking to ya, boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.77,1:30:31.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.94,1:30:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些尖头怪从没见过飞机吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't none of you pointy-heads ever seen an airplane before?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.82,1:30:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯 你还在吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James? James, are you still there?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.66,1:30:45.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到吗? 我想车已经停下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you hear me? I think we've stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.26,1:31:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要报告的就是这么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is really all there is to report, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.52,1:31:13.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若我没听错 斯卡曼加已经逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if I heard correctly, Scaramanga got away.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.85,1:31:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.06,1:31:17.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搭一辆长了翅膀的汽车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a car that sprouted wings.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.11,1:31:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那绝对可行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's perfectly feasible, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.98,1:31:20.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也正在研究这样的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact, we're working on one now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.61,1:31:22.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Q 住嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , Q, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.20,1:31:25.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚安在行李厢 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And Miss Goodnight was in the boot. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.20,1:31:26.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那辆飞机汽车被扔弃在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found the car-plane abandoned
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.95,1:31:29.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曼谷以西二百里的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about 200 miles west of Bangkok.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.66,1:31:32.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那太阳能感应器呢?  - 在晚安的手袋内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And the solex? - In Goodnight's handbag , sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.21,1:31:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那晚安现在在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Goodnight now?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.50,1:31:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.09,1:31:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通讯系统接收不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Communications aren't picking up the signal
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.21,1:31:40.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引导装置的讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the homer she has, supplied by Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.30,1:31:42.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,废话! 他们只是没把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rubbish! They're simply not stepping up...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.63,1:31:44.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接收率提高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the reception sufficiently to enable.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.72,1:31:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Q 住嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , shut up, Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.76,1:31:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是混乱无能的运作!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of all the fouled-up, half-witted operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.98,1:31:51.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M: What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.06,1:31:53.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们接收到晚安的讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've picked up Goodnight's signal , sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.35,1:31:55.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有消息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well , that's something .
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.44,1:31:58.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过有些颇奇怪的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there is something rather curious, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.19,1:32:02.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our sector's here
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.11,1:32:04.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而她的讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we're receiving her signal from somewhere
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.03,1:32:07.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来自这里离岸的某地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}off this coastline off shore here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.37,1:32:10.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一张是较大的比例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, here it is on a much larger scale.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.00,1:32:12.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.20,1:32:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这群小岛里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In this group of small islands.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.12,1:32:16.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们需要的 中国共产党水域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M: That's all we need , Red Chinese waters.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.96,1:32:20.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以当疏忽迷路闯了进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well , we could stray inadvertently into them , sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.30,1:32:22.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以飞在他们雷达 侦测范围以下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could fly low under their radar screen .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.26,1:32:24.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely out of the question .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.09,1:32:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果首相知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the PM gets to hear of this,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.01,1:32:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会把我吊死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he'll hang me from the yardarm .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.43,1:32:32.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正式来说 你什么也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officially, you won't know a thing about it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.43,1:33:53.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一架小型海上飞机飞近你的岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a small seaplane approaching your island .
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.85,1:33:55.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我们采取行动吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want us to take any action?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.02,1:33:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用 请什么也不要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, please don't do anything .
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.11,1:34:03.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 是一个我等着来的客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it's a guest I'm expecting .
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.57,1:34:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 他不会离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he won't be leaving .
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.28,1:35:32.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是尼拿克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Nick Nack.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.70,1:35:40.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我比较喜欢1962年的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I prefer the '62 myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.25,1:35:43.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过总比一包花生味道要好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still , beats a bag of peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.54,1:35:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯卡曼加先生会亲自欢迎你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monsieur Scaramanga will welcome you personally.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.84,1:35:53.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me, Mr. Bond .
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.59,1:35:56.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表现很不得体 但我无法抗拒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A vulgar display, but I couldn't resist it
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.85,1:35:59.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为再见到你太高兴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I am so delighted to see you again .
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.18,1:36:01.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没杀伤力的玩具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A harmless toy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.64,1:36:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以看到 我是完全没有携械的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am , as you can see now, completeIy unarmed .
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.81,1:36:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,香烟?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.65,1:36:11.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有许多相同之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have so much in common , Mr. Bond .
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.32,1:36:12.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有很多事讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have so much to discuss,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.65,1:36:14.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将来不再有这个机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we will never have this opportunity again .
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.03,1:36:16.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的职业是最孤独的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ours is the loneliest profession ,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.82,1:36:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们共聚数小时吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so let us spend a few pleasant hours together.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.24,1:36:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我如何能拒绝这样殷勤的邀请?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can I refuse such a gracious invitation?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.91,1:36:24.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Splendid . Splendid !
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.37,1:36:28.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼拿克 我期望你有超水准表现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick Nack, I expect you to surpass yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.54,1:36:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是一流名厨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a Cordon Bleu , you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.09,1:36:32.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是了 晚安小姐在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, where's Miss Goodnight?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.34,1:36:36.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在这儿附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , she's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.76,1:36:37.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没办法离开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no way for her to leave,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.01,1:36:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以是行动自如的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so she does as she pleases.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.89,1:36:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢我的岛吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you like my island?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.02,1:36:43.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点偏僻 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bit off the beaten track, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.93,1:36:47.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是免费出租的 我偶尔给我的房东些恩惠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's rent-free. I do my landlords an occasional favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.65,1:36:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很布置的安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cozy arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.86,1:36:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聘请佣人麻烦吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Servant problem , I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.32,1:36:52.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at all .
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.90,1:36:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼拿克很称职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick Nack does for me very nicely.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.86,1:36:59.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通常只有我俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Usually there's just the two of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.37,1:37:00.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过客人到来也很方便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but having guests is no inconvenience.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.95,1:37:02.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们自给自足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're entirely self-supporting .
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.37,1:37:04.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有你能想到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have every electrical laborsaving device
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.12,1:37:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,省电的装置都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you could possibIy think of.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.37,1:37:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一间密封室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is an air lock, as you are doubtless aware.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.17,1:37:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是自动化的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Automatic, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.76,1:37:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实 我们这里有充足电力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Naturally, we have an ample supply of electricity here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.93,1:37:22.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我给你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me show you .
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.45,1:37:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里应该可以供电 给几只电动牙刷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This should run a few electric toothbrushes.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.28,1:37:42.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.54,1:37:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿就是太阳能源站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A solar energy station .
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.71,1:37:51.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是关于它的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is what it's all about.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.25,1:37:54.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,热电发电机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thermoelectric generators to convert
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.42,1:37:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将太阳能转化为电力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}solar energy into electricity.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.42,1:38:00.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是由海发建筑公司建造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All built by Hai Fat's construction company, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.30,1:38:02.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我继承了他的企业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow I seem to have inherited it from him .
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.97,1:38:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是全自动的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all fully automated .
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.85,1:38:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是克拉 看管一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Kra, maintenance and security.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.52,1:38:07.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若尼拿克不是在擦亮银器时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looks after everything in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.89,1:38:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会做其余的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick Nack does everything else when he isn't polishing the silver.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.56,1:38:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说电力储藏在附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They tell me the electricity is stored in here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.61,1:38:17.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科学站始终不是我的长处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Science was never my strong point.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.20,1:38:22.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超导电线圈 被液化氦冷却\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superconductivity coils cooled by liquid helium .
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.16,1:38:25.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若我是你就不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I were you , I wouldn't stick my finger,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.99,1:38:28.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把手指插进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or anything else for that matter, in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.62,1:38:30.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在零下453度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At 453 degrees below zero,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.00,1:38:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,液体氦气 会像折冰柱般折断它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that liquid helium would break it off like an icicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.79,1:38:36.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然比我知道多许多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really know far more about it than I do, Mr. Bond .
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.63,1:38:39.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在请求每个国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm arranging for every country that can afford the price
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.09,1:38:41.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,派专家到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to send their experts here to see for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.55,1:38:44.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但要直到收到钱 才有那太阳能感应器 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But no solex until the money is in the bank. Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.64,1:38:46.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.72,1:38:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我经历过类似的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have run across similar situations.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.39,1:38:51.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有像我这里的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not what I've got here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.23,1:38:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最高竞投者可兴建\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way the highest bidder can build
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.19,1:38:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数百个站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hundreds of these stations
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.48,1:38:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再出售数百个特许经营权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sell franchises for hundreds more.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.36,1:39:01.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会赚得荷包满满的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will literally have the sun in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.82,1:39:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太阳能的独家经营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A monopoly on solar power.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.28,1:39:08.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石油酋长会收买你 以防止你把太阳能推出市场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The oil sheiks will pay you just to keep solar energy off the market.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.70,1:39:11.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也这样想过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thought had occurred to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.92,1:39:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是收集的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the collection point.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.64,1:39:35.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是它被放置的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah . So that's where it belongs.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.27,1:39:37.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在热交换器的太阳能感应器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our famous solex in the still down there
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.32,1:39:39.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把热力输送到发热器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}transmits heat to the thermal generators.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.99,1:39:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,透过这个收集的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's collected through this?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.91,1:39:50.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过从何收集?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But where is it collected from?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.62,1:39:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need the sun .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.20,1:40:04.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着那蘑菇型的石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch that mushroom-shaped rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.02,1:40:28.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很巧妙 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ingenious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.56,1:40:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把面板锁定太阳的位置 然后它自动追踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The panels lock on to the sun and then track it automatically.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.98,1:40:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,类似这样吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something like that, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.20,1:40:42.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.36,1:40:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些面板必须要制造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reflected through this, those panels must produce a heat
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.28,1:40:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少华氏3500度的热力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of at least 3,500 degrees Fahrenheit.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.33,1:40:49.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以这样说 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you say so, Mr. Bond .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.87,1:40:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可在任何地方把能源集中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do know that we can focus the power wherever we want.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.54,1:40:57.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来这边 我给你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here. I'll show you .
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.01,1:41:01.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是额外的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a bonus.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.34,1:41:07.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连太阳能感应器一起发售 不另收费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goes with the solex. No extra charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.66,1:41:30.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢这部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the part I really like.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.88,1:41:43.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我所称的太阳能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that's what I call solar power.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.80,1:41:47.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我称这做麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I call trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.68,1:41:51.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得承认 我是不折不扣的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must admit, Mr. Bond , I am now undeniably
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.31,1:41:52.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,金枪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Man with the Golden Gun .
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.02,1:42:00.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午餐时候到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah . Lunch .
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.79,1:42:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请到这边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, Mr. Bond .
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.00,1:42:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah ! Miss Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.67,1:42:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James !
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.84,1:42:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是穿得太讲究吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't we a little overdressed , Goodnight?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.84,1:42:28.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢女孩穿比基尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like a girl in a bikini .
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.68,1:42:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会隐藏武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No concealed weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.43,1:42:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安小姐 请坐 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Goodnight, please. Mr. Bond .
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.64,1:42:37.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看尼拿克为我们准备了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now let's see what Nick Nack has for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.56,1:42:39.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是蘑菇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah . Mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.44,1:42:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炒蘑菇似乎很有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fried mushroom looks terribly interesting .
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.36,1:42:49.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也留意到 我晚点再吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I noticed that. I'll get around to it later.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.12,1:42:54.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太阳下好玩吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having fun in the sun , Goodnight?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.95,1:42:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.12,1:42:59.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以永远留在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could stay here forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.29,1:43:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm !
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.30,1:43:04.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.42,1:43:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点像1934年的慕东\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slightly reminiscent of a '34 Mouton .
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.22,1:43:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我一定要把它加在酒窖里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I must add it to my cellar.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.18,1:43:13.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的生活真写意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You live well , Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.06,1:43:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次交易都得一百万 这让我负担得起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At a million dollars a contract, I can afford to, Mr. Bond .
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.27,1:43:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为一小点金钱工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You work for peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.81,1:43:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只获得英女皇一句由衷的赞赏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hearty "well done" from Her Majesty the Queen
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.15,1:43:23.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和少量的退休金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a pittance of a pension .
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.65,1:43:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除此之外我们都是一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apart from that, we are the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.45,1:43:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为我们干一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To us, Mr. Bond .
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.66,1:43:31.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是最出色的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.91,1:43:35.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个很有用的形容词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a useful four-letter word ,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.20,1:43:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,形容你很贴切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're full of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.79,1:43:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀人时 都是按政府给我的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I kill , it's on the specific orders of my government.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.00,1:43:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我杀的都是杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And those I kill are themselves killers.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.01,1:43:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , come, come, Mr. Bond .
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.80,1:43:48.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对你很失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.01,1:43:51.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,承认你杀人时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get as much fulfillment out of killing as I do,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.09,1:43:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如我一样很有满足感吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so why don't you admit it?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.43,1:43:54.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我承认杀你会很满足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I admit killing you would be a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.97,1:43:56.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最初见到我时就应杀掉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've done that when you first saw me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.85,1:43:58.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,英国人不认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then of course the English don't consider it
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.35,1:44:01.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷血杀人有风度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sporting to kill in cold blood , do they?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.60,1:44:03.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别指望这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't count on that.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.70,1:44:16.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可在你登陆时射杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could've shot you down when you landed
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.58,1:44:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是最不费劲的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that would've been ridiculously easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.92,1:44:26.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像每个伟大的艺术家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, Mr. Bond , like every great artist,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.67,1:44:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想在人生中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to create an indisputable
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.88,1:44:31.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,创一次丰功伟绩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}masterpiece once in my Iifetime.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.47,1:44:34.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,007之死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The death of 007,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.68,1:44:38.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}face to face,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.64,1:44:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胜利将属于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.10,1:44:45.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你指装饰和展览 你这个石制壁炉架?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean , stuffed and displayed over your rocky mantelpiece?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.40,1:44:49.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个主意很有趣 但我是以历史作考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's an amusing idea, but I was thinking in terms of history.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.40,1:44:51.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个巨人的决斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A duel between titans.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.36,1:44:55.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的金枪对你的沃尔达PPK\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My golden gun against your Walther PPK.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.83,1:44:58.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家机会均等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each of us with a 50-50 chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.58,1:45:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我六颗子弹对你一颗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six bullets to your one?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.08,1:45:02.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只需要一颗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only need one.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.75,1:45:07.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听来有点老套吧 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds a bit oId-fashioned , doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.00,1:45:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我意思是 黎明时份决斗的那种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean , pistols at dawn , that sort of thing .
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.09,1:45:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed , it is, Mr. Bond ,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.76,1:45:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这仍是男子汉的最好考验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it still remains the only true test for gentlemen .
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.81,1:45:20.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕你没资格取得胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt if you qualify on that score.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.02,1:45:24.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我接受你挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, I accept.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.19,1:45:28.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我先吃掉尼拿克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as I finish this delicious lunch
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.61,1:45:30.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为我们弄的美味午餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Nick Nack has prepared for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.28,1:45:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两位 让我提醒你们 这是生死决战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Messieurs, I will remind you this is un duella mort.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.87,1:45:40.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有其中一人可离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only one of you can leave the fieId of honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.87,1:45:43.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果需要最后一枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If a coup de grce is necessary,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.12,1:45:47.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为裁判的我会亲自操刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as your referee, I will administer it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.21,1:45:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我预料没有损伤 要干净利落的一死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not expect wounds. Only a clean kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.47,1:45:55.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我指挥下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my command
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.47,1:45:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双方要退后二十步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}each contestant will take 20 paces.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.56,1:46:03.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗?  斯卡曼加先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready, Monsieur Scaramanga?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.81,1:46:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.86,1:46:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗 邦德先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready, Monsieur Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.27,1:46:10.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.61,1:46:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开始数了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will now begin the count.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.99,1:46:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三 四 五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1 , 2, 3, 4, 5,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.99,1:46:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,六 七 八 九\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}6, 7, 8, 9,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.66,1:46:28.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十 十一 十二 十三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10, 11 , 12, 13,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.21,1:46:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十四 十五 十六\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}14, 15, 16,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.67,1:46:37.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十七 十八 十九 二十!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}17, 18, 19, 20 !
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.89,1:47:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you kill him ,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.76,1:47:24.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里一切都是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all this be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.06,1:47:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生 到这边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, Monsieur Bond .
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.06,1:48:09.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,射得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monsieur, good shooting .
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.89,1:48:12.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没杀过侏儒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never killed a midget before,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.27,1:48:14.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过凡事总有第一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there can always be a first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.77,1:48:16.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.02,1:49:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只剩下三颗子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You only have three bullets left!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.70,1:49:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我耍你的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fooled you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.36,1:53:15.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚安 - 詹姆斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Goodnight. - James !
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.62,1:53:17.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.87,1:53:19.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镇定点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady, Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.95,1:53:21.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.25,1:53:24.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毙命在最后一击下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flat on his coup de grce.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.50,1:53:27.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快离开这鬼地方 和找出那个太阳能感应器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on . Let's get out of this fun palace and find that solex.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.85,1:53:39.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.22,1:53:40.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去对付那维修工人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take care of the maintenance man .
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.85,1:53:42.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经搞定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already did .
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.85,1:53:44.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他冷僵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I laid him out cold .
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.77,1:53:46.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你?  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You did? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.90,1:53:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的不如外表看来那么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more to you than meets the eye, Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.62,1:54:01.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想问愚蠢的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodnight, I hate to ask stupid questions,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.75,1:54:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但究竟你是在哪里弄死他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but where exactly did you knock him cold?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.17,1:54:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他掉在那个池内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He landed in that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.79,1:54:09.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不信告示的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you believe in signs?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.30,1:54:11.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他的体温 让氦气提升到零度以上之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got about five minutes before his
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.13,1:54:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还剩下大约五分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}body temperature raises that helium well above zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.26,1:54:16.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着这整个地方就会爆炸!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then this whole damn place will go sky high .
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.80,1:54:19.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起! 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.80,1:55:42.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关掉那道光!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill the beam !
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.39,1:55:46.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按撤销主按钮!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit the master override switch !
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.48,1:55:47.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The what?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.73,1:55:49.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodnight?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.48,1:55:50.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.56,1:55:52.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留心听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.07,1:55:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面有个操纵台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a console up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.61,1:55:57.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必定有一个扫描连锁按钮的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, there must be a scanner interlock button on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.90,1:55:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push it!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.74,1:56:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodnight, are you still there?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.83,1:56:05.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那应该在辅助反馈电路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be on the auxiliary feedback circuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.79,1:56:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"电脑连锁"是这个吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer interlock. Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.42,1:56:13.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把每个都按下 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just push every damn button , will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.77,1:56:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安 做得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good girl , Goodnight. You've done it.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.98,1:56:36.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做到了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , I have?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.49,1:57:23.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快离开 我拿到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodnight, get the hell out of there ! I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.65,1:57:58.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真希望你会游泳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you can swim , Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.02,1:58:00.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.69,1:58:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的中式帆船就停在转角处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His junk is moored around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.97,1:59:10.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁掌舵的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, darling , who is at the wheel?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.35,1:59:11.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 乔治 - 乔治?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- George. - George?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.10,1:59:14.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自动船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Automatic pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.27,1:59:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应在八小时内 抵达香港\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should make Hong Kong in about eight hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.27,1:59:24.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出入不会太大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give or take a littIe.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.55,1:59:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都想从中国乘一艘慢船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always wanted to take a slow boat from China.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.14,2:00:34.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you .
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.51,2:00:37.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀死你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you !
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.10,2:00:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, you . . .
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.69,2:01:25.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等! 等一下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.15,2:01:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个王八蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch ! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.86,2:01:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你在干嘛呢?  快点进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey, what are you doing? Get in there.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.41,2:01:35.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ouch !
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.91,2:01:39.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无法呼吸!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on ! I can't breathe !
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.70,2:01:41.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.58,2:01:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会后悔的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be sorry!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.58,2:01:46.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我虽然矮小 但我的记性很好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may be small , but I never forget!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.92,2:01:53.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不放我出来我就杀掉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you if you don't let me out of here ! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.43,2:01:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放我出来! 你这大坏蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me out, you big bully!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.05,2:01:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.02,2:02:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎样处置他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do with him?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.94,2:02:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.02,2:02:08.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯 不是吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , James, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.69,2:02:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是那样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I damn well did .
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.32,2:02:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信你已把玻璃清理好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got all the glass out of the bed , I trust.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.91,2:02:18.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不想有别的东西妨碍我们 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't want anything else to disturb our peace, do we?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.62,2:02:28.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在 刚才到哪了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.00,2:02:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , James.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.68,2:02:43.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.27,2:02:46.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有事发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something came up.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.15,2:02:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.48,2:02:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到你了 邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah ! There you are, Bond .
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.86,2:02:57.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做得好 恭喜你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.95,2:02:59.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you , sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.12,2:03:02.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安小姐在吗? 我想跟她谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Miss Goodnight with you? I'd like a word with her.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.54,2:03:04.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on , sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.59,2:03:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德? 你在吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond? Bond, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.09,2:03:20.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodnight?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.01,2:03:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她快来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's just coming , sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.36,2:03:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodnight?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.53,2:03:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚安 - 晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Goodnight. - Good night, sir.
